Analyze code for metrics and issues

Usage: souc analyze [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Input file (or directory)

Options:
      --analysis <ANALYSIS>  Analysis type (metrics, dead-code, all) [default: all]
      --format <FORMAT>      Output format (text, json) [default: text]
      --verbose              Show detailed output
  -h, --help                 Print help
